<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We have granted the underwriter an option for
a period ending 45 days after the date of this prospectus to purchase up to an additional Class A ordinary shares and/or warrants at the
public offering price, less the underwriting discounts, solely to cover over-allotments, if any. If the underwriter exercises the option
in full, the total underwriting discounts will be $ , and the total proceeds to us, before expenses, will be $ .</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We expect that delivery of the Class A ordinary
shares, the warrants and Pre-funded Warrants being offered pursuant to this prospectus supplement and the accompanying prospectus will
be made on or about February 1, 2023, subject to customary closing conditions.</P>



<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

