    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The exercise price of each warrant is $ per Class
    A ordinary share, subject to adjustment therein. Each Warrant will be exercisable from the date of issuance until , 202 , subject to an
    ownership limitation. See &ldquo;Description of Securities We Are Offering&mdash;Warrants.&rdquo; This prospectus supplement also relates
