<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Notes:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(1) Additional paid-in capital reflects the issuance
and sale of Class A ordinary shares at the offering price of $ per Class A ordinary share and warrants at the offering price of $ per
warrant (assuming no issuance of Pre-funded Warrants and no exercise of the warrants issued in connection with this offering), after deducting
underwriting discounts, non-accountable expense allowance, and estimated offering expenses payable by us. The as adjusted information
is illustrative only. We estimate that such net proceeds will be approximately $ ($ gross offering proceeds, less underwriting discounts,
non-accountable expense allowance of approximately $ , and estimated offering expenses of approximately $ ).</P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

