<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">We are being represented by Hunter Taubman Fischer
 &amp; Li LLC with respect to certain legal matters as to United States federal securities and New York State law. The validity of the
securities offered in this offering and certain other legal matters as to British Virgin Islands law will be passed upon for us by Carey
Olsen Singapore LLP, our counsel as to British Virgin Islands law. Legal matters as to PRC law will be passed upon for us by Yingke Wuxi
Law Firm.&nbsp;Hunter Taubman Fischer &amp; Li LLC may rely upon Carey Olsen Singapore LLP with respect to matters governed by British
Virgin Islands law and Yingke Wuxi Law Firm with respect to matters governed by PRC law. Certain legal matters in connection with this
offering will be passed upon for the underwriter by Ellenoff Grossman &amp; Schole LLP with respect to U.S. laws.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

